# 仅作为变量说明；应用不自动加载 .env。请通过服务端环境注入。
# EN: This file documents environment variables; the app does not load .env automatically. Inject values into the server environment.
# 配置服务端端口；启动器会协调实际监听端口，供本机界面连接。
# EN: Configure the server port; the launcher coordinates the actual listening port used by local UI connections.
ELYSIA_PORT=4317
# 默认端口被占用时自动改用空闲端口；0 表示始终由系统分配。
# EN: Fall back to a free port when the default is occupied; zero always requests a system-assigned port.
# 开发前端端口与服务端分开配置；数据目录覆盖仅影响显式使用该环境的进程。
# EN: Configure the development frontend port separately; a data-directory override applies to processes using this environment.
# ELYSIA_WEB_PORT=5173  # 仅 pnpm dev，冲突时自动递增
# EN: ELYSIA_WEB_PORT applies only to pnpm dev and increments automatically on conflicts.
# ELYSIA_DATA_DIR=C:\Users\your-name\AppData\Local\Elysia
# 可选：覆盖自动发现的 Codex CLI 路径；订阅通道要求 0.160.0 或更新版本。
# EN: Optionally override the discovered Codex CLI path; the subscription channel requires version 0.160.0 or newer.
# ELYSIA_CODEX_BINARY=C:\path\to\codex.exe
# API 密钥示例留空，真实值通过本地环境提供；不要把凭据写入版本库。
# EN: API keys are intentionally empty; provide real values through the local environment and keep credentials out of Git.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# Agent 终端环境变量模式：Claude Code 使用 Anthropic Key；Antigravity / Gemini 使用 Gemini Key。
# EN: In terminal environment mode, Claude Code uses the Anthropic key; Antigravity/Gemini use the Gemini key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
